#   paintable_fragment - Painting::PaintableFragment: a line box fragment in the paint tree
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/PaintableFragment.cpp (lines 1-302) and PaintableFragment.h's
#       inline members: a fragment made from a Layout::LineBoxFragment, its absolute rect and
#       orientation, the code unit under a point (grapheme by grapheme through the glyph run's
#       clusters), selection offsets and the rect of a range of its text.
